/*
  QuickNav.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0129 · QuickNav (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `QuickNav` resolves (table "QuickNav") lives here with its web `t(key, default)`
  English value. These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master
  catalog at integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel
  surface prompt owns its own strings without editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact set of keys extracted from the web source
  (features/dashboard/components/QuickNav.tsx): the per-shortcut label/description
  keys the `NAV_ITEMS` map resolves via `t(nav.x, …)` / `t(nav.xDesc, …)`. The second
  group backs the native-only chrome — the VoiceOver copy and the loading / empty /
  error / connectivity states the prompt requires — keyed so the Swift sources hold
  no English literals.
*/

